# LF everywhere, on every OS. A Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true on the
# GitHub runners) would otherwise turn the fixtures into CRLF and break the
# byte-for-byte tests against song.json and the Rust snapshots.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.wav binary
*.png binary
*.ico binary

# Test inputs and snapshots (compared byte for byte, binary renders): never
# rewritten by a checkout.
crates/*/tests/fixtures/** -text
